#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:24
msgid "Profile data, validation, and views"
msgstr "Dades del perfil, validació i vistes"

#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:26
msgid ""
"`ProfileValidationService` judges a complete merged fact set against an "
"injected schema. It routes value-shape decisions to the domain authority "
"and reports stable issue codes for invalid enum/date/number/boolean/email"
" values, unknown paths, attempted writes to derived selectors, and "
"malformed indexed instances. Only required and conditional-required "
"absences count as incompleteness that can be deferred during setup; "
"malformed values and forbidden fields block even an incomplete profile. "
"Clears are admitted even for retired or derived paths so operators can "
"remove obsolete stored values, while cleared facts no longer contribute "
"to presence or projections. Required-field checking uses row-aware "
"helpers and effective facts. `reject_invalid_profile_facts` is the shared"
" write boundary and checks the whole resulting sequence so an invalid "
"batch cannot be partly applied. validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`ProfileValidationService` jutja un conjunt complet combinat de fets "
"contra un esquema injectat. Encamina les decisions de forma de valor cap "
"a l'autoritat del domini i informa de codis estables d'incidència per a "
"valors no vàlids d'enumeració, data, número, booleà i correu electrònic, "
"camins desconeguts, intents d'escriptura a selectors derivats i "
"instàncies indexades malformades. Només les absències obligatòries i "
"condicionalment obligatòries compten com a incompletesa ajornable durant "
"la configuració; els valors malformats i camps prohibits bloquegen fins i"
" tot un perfil incomplet. Les eliminacions s'admeten fins i tot per a "
"camins retirats o derivats perquè els operadors puguin eliminar valors "
"desats obsolets, mentre que els fets eliminats ja no contribueixen a "
"presència o projeccions. La comprovació de camps obligatoris utilitza "
"ajudants conscients de files i fets efectius. "
"`reject_invalid_profile_facts` és el límit compartit d'escriptura i "
"comprova tota la seqüència resultant perquè un lot no vàlid no es pugui "
"aplicar parcialment. validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
